<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yakubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Yakubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakubu</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Yakubu nachandichigwa na munhu yumwe nayachemigwe Yakubu. Yakubu hanji nayali mng'holoze Yesu, nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwaluko cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu na nayawele yumwe wa chitala cha Yelusalemu (Madito 15:13). Mtumigwa Paoli nakamchema ayu kota izengo lya chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kuli Galatiya (Wagalatiya 2:9). Wasomile wangukunda kota chitabu cha Yakubu nachandichigwa kung'hali kufika mwaka wa makumi gahano, Yesu loyavumbuche. Kwa vila Yakubu nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Yelusalemu, hanji nakandika chitabu achi loyawele yochikala ako Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakubu nakandika chitabu achi kwa “Nhanzi kumi na mbili,” zisambaluche muisi yeng'ha (Yakubu 1:1). Malanguso kuli chitabu cha Yakubu ndo cha walingumkunda Kilistu weng'ha hanga heye nakalonga, “Nhanzi kumi na mbili,” hanji yangoneka kota Yakubu nakandika ng'hatu kwa Wayahudi walingumuwinza Kilistu. Kwa vila chitabu achi changuganigwa chiwafichile wanhu wenji walingusoma, mina yangulonga kuli mbuli nyinji, Yakubu heye kangulola kiwhana kwa makundo na madito. Makundo ga kukomya galajilwa kwa madito (Yakubu 2:17). Kahi kanguwakanya kwa chinhu cha kuleka kuwaganilila wanhu wawele na lufufu (Yakubu 2:1-4), na kahi kanguwalonjela kota welolele kwa chila chinhu chowalingulonga (Yakubu 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Yakubu kanguwalamsa walingusoma (Yakubu 1:1).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba kanguwakangaza nhumbula wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, kwimilila howofichigwa na magazo (Yakubu 1:2-27).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Hamba kangulonga vila makundo vyogalingulajilwa kwa madito (Yakubu 2:1-26).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Yolawa baho kangulonga ndaze ulonzi vyouwa na ludali (Yakubu 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="io">5. Kahi Yakubu kangusima luhala lwa Nguluwi vyoluwele lutanganiche kusinda luhala lwa isi yeng'ha (Yakubu 3:13-4:10).</para>
  <para style="io">6. Kahi kanguwakanya walingusoma weyuse kuli mbuli ya kidaya (Yakubu 4:11-5:6).</para>
  <para style="io">7. Yakubu kangugwisa chilasi kuli chitabu achi kwa malajizo gali vinji kuli sula ya 5:7-20.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Ulamso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Heni Yakubu, chitumagwa wa Nguluwi na wa Mkulu Yesu Kilistu, ndanguwalamsani hemwe nhanzi kumi na mbili, zisambaluche kuli isi yeng'ha!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makundo na luhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Wang'holozangu, msangalale mhela homfichigwa na nongwa zinji, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />kwa vila mvizela kota kujezigwa kwa makundo ga hemwe kwangigala kwimilila. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Mlole kota kwimilila kwa hemwe kowafichiza mbaka kuduma, kowadita mkangale leka muwe mwenele kwa chila chinhu ne kwisilwa chinhu choneche. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ila wone yumwe wa hemwe kahela luhala, lelo, kanguganigwa yamlande Nguluwi, yalinguwapa wanhu weng'ha kwa winji na kwa isungu, naye kopegwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ila kanguganigwa kulanda kwa makundo ne kuwa na lunhwinhwi wa chinhu choneche. Munhu yawele na lunhwinhwi ndo kota nhigu ya bahali iwele kukundujizwa na kutagangwa na mbeho. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Munhu kota ayo yaleche kijesa kota kobochela chinhu choneche kulawa kwa Mkulu. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Munhu yawele na majesa, yawele na kunuwila kwili kuli gala geng'ha goyodita heye, yaleche kijesa kota kopegwa choneche kulawa kwa Mkulu.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzunwa na lufufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Mng'holozo yawele mzunwa, kangulapigwa yasangalale mhela Nguluwi hoyomwinula, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />naye yawele na lufufu kangulapigwa yasangalale mhela Nguluwi hoyomdulisa. Mina yawele na lufufu kokwaga kota uluwa wa kisolo. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Isanya lisomozaga na ivuche lyake ling'hang'hale na mizuchila jangukala, uluwa wangugwa hasi na kunoga kwesa kwangwiha. Vivyo du, yawele na lufufu kobagamizwa hoyowa mli mijito ja heye.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujezigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Kobweda munhu wakukundigwa kuli ngwimilila mhela wakujezigwa, kwa vila wone yemilile, kopegwa chonolo cha ukomu Nguluwi yalagane na hewo walingumgana. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Wone munhu yajezigwe yaleche kulonga, “Ndangujezigwa na Nguluwi.” Mina Nguluwi halingujezigwa kwa wihe, naye halingumjeza munhu yoneche kwa wihe. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Chila munhu kangujezigwa kwa kuhadigwa na kugwila kuli maya ga heye gehile. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Maya gehile hogokangala, gangigala wihe, nawo wihe houkangala, hamba wangigala kubagama.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Wang'holozangu ndiwaganile, mleche kuhadigwa! <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Chila ndolendole inojile na yenele na haipunguche yangudulika kulawa kilanga kwa Mhaza, yalumbile vimulimuli vyeng'ha viwele kuulanga hambe yagaluche na kahela ulajilo woneche wa kulajila kota kogaluka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Kwa igano lyake yuye, nakatugalila ukomu unyale kukolela ulonzi wa heye wa kukomya, nakatudita tuwe honhu ha mwaluko hali vilumbigwe vya heye vyeng'ha.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhulika na kuuditila mijito usenga wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Wang'holozangu ndiwaganile, mvizele mbuli ayi! Chila munhu yaleche kukawila kuhulika ila yakawile kulonga na kuzudila. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Kwa vila wanhu wawele nguzudila howoweza kudita ganojile gawele ga hachi hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Lelo mgaleche gehile na wihe womlinawo, mbochele kwa nhumbula iholile ula ulonzi unyaligwe mnhumbula za hemwe, ali lyoweza kuwalohola hemwe. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Mleche kihada mwemwe yeka kwa kuhulichiza ulonzi hela, ila mgaditile mijito. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Yoneche yalinguhulichiza ulonzi awo ila halingudita choyalingulonga, ayo ndo kewhana na munhu yalingilola kumeho hali chilolelo, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />kochilola yuye, hamba kanguluta na baho kangisemwa vyoyali. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ila munhu yalingulola goya malajizo ga kugongomanya, galinguwapa wanhu kilejeha, munhu yalingulutilila kudita ago na haiwele kuhulika hela, ila kangibatilila, munhu ayo kotambichizwa na Nguluwi kuli chila chinhu choyalingudita.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Wone munhu yochijesa mnhumbula kota kangumfugamila Nguluwi, ila kangulemwela kuulemeza umyango wa heye, kangihada yuye na kumfugamila kwa heye hakulingumtanza chinhu. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Kumfugamila Nguluwi Mhaza wa hetwe kunojile na kulihela nongwa hali heye ndo aku, kuwatanza wana walekwa na wadala wafililwe na walume wa hewo kuli magazo gawo na kilolela gwegwe baho uleche kujeligwa wavu na mbuli zihile za isi ayi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa chiwalo cha uganilila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Wang'holozangu, wone mwangumkunda Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu, Mkulu wa ukulu, mleche kuwaganilila wanhu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Wone munhu yumwe yawele na lufufu yavalile pete ya zahabu na nguwo zinojile kangwinjila hali nhing'hano ya hemwe na baho du nakenjila munhu yawele mzunwa yavalile nguwo zidejeche, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />wone umbochele goya yula yavalile goya na kumlonjela, “Wikale hano honhu hawele hanojile,” ila kwangumlonjela yula mzunwa, “Hegwe, wime hala,” ama “Wikalise aha hasi” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />hambi ako hakuwele kuwabagula wanji? Ndaze, namwe baho vyomlingutagusa hamlingulongozwa na majesa gehile?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Wang'holozangu mnyhulichize, Nguluwi kawahagula wanhu wazunwa walihela lufufu wa isi ayi leka wawe na makundo kwa winji na kubochela undewa yoyalagane nawo walingumgana. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ila hemwe mwanguwabeza wanhu wazunwa. Ndaze, wawele na lufufu hawawele ndo wawo walinguwambuzani hemwe na kuwahilikani kuli utaguso? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ndaze, hawawele ndo wawo walinguliliga itagwa lila linojile lya Kilistu muwele hemwe ndo wanhu wa heye?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Mowa mdita goya wone mlinguwinza lila ilajizo lya undewa wa Nguluwi lyandichigwe mli Maandiko Matakatifu, “Umgane myago yomlingikalasa habehi kota vyoulingigana gwegwe baho,” mowa mdita mbuli zinojile. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ila wone muwe mganilila wanhu, mwangudita gehile, nago malajizo ga Nguluwi, gangulajila kota wanhu awo wana nongwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Mina munhu yoneche wone yobeza ilajizo limwe hela kuli malajizo ga Nguluwi, kowa na nongwa ya kuleka kuwinza malajizo geng'ha. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Mina yuyula yalonjile “Uleche kudita ung'hondwa,” Ndo yalonjile “Uleche kukopola.” Ahyo, wone hegwe hulingudita ung'hondwa ila kwangukopola, hegwe hambe uwinze malajizo gose ga Nguluwi. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Lelo, mlonje na kudita kota wanhu wokuya kutagusigwa kwa malajizo galingigala kilejeha. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Mina, Nguluwi homonela isungu hoyomtagusa munhu yalingidaya yasowile isungu. Ila isungu lya Nguluwi lyangusumya utaguso.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makundo na madito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Wang'holozangu, yotanza choni wone munhu yoneche yalonje kana makundo, ila halingulajila kwa madito? Ndaze, ago makundo goweza kumlohola? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Wone wang'holozo wawe hela mivalo ama vilyo, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />yowatanza choni homuwalonjela, “Mlute goya, mkote chiluli na migute,” Ne kumha vinhu vya lukuli vyowalingugana kuli ukomu wa hewo? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Hiho du, makundo galiyeng'ha ne madito gabagama.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ila munhu yunji kolonga, “Hegwe kwanago makundo na heni ndanago madito.” Undajile makundo ga hegwe ne madito heni ndokulajila makundo ga heni kwa madito. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ndaze, hegwe kwangukunda kota kabaho Nguluwi yumwe hela? Goya! Ila jimazoga jangukunda ago, najo jangukakama kwa kudumba. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Kwa mpoka hegwe! Ndaze, ahyo kwangugana kulajilwa kota makundo ne madito gahela chinhu? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Ndaze, Abulahamu sekulu wa hetwe nakakundigwa kota kanginojeza hali meho ga Nguluwi? Ndo kwa madito ga heye, hala nayamlavile nhambiko mwanage Isaka kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Lelo kwangona makundo ga heye nagaluta hamwe na madito gake na kahi makundo ga heye nagagongomanyizwa na chila choyaditile kwa madito ga heye. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ahyo nagenela gala Maandiko Matakatifu galingulonga, “Abulahamu nakamkunda Nguluwi na kwa makundo ga heye nakamtawiza kota katanganika, ahyo Abulahamu nakachemigwa mganwa wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Lelo, mwangona kota munhu kanguwazigwa kota kangumnojeza Nguluwi kwa kukolela madito ne haiwele kwa makundo galiyeka.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Hiho du, kwa yula mng'hondwa Lahabu heye nayali yawazigwe kamnojeza Nguluwi, kwa gala goyaditile hala loyawabochele goya wala wapugajizi Waisilaeli na kuwatanza walawe kwa kukolela nzila yinji. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Mina kota vila lukuli luwele hela muhe, ubagama, Hiho du makundo kuli hela madito gabagama.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuudima umyango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Wang'holozangu, wenji wa hemwe waleche kuwa walangusa. Kota vyomvizelele, hetwe walangusa, topegwa utaguso ukulu ng'hatu kusinda wanji. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Mina hetwe tweng'ha twanguwifya kuli mbuli nyinji. Munhu yohambe yekwang'wale kuli ulonzi, ayo ka munhu yatanganiche, koweza kuulongoza lukuli lwa heye. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Hetwe tweng'ha twanguwoha chipande chido cha chuma kwa ng'weso mmilomo ja falasi leka watuhulichize, kwa kukolela ayo, toweza kugalamla lukuli lwa hewo lweng'ha. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Kahi mlole mitumbwi mikulu, hanga ndo ng'hulu ng'hatu, jangukundujizwa na mbeho ng'hulu, ila jangulongozwa na itela idodo ng'hatu, kweng'ha koyogana kuluta mlongoza itumbwi. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Hiho du umyango ndo chitomo chidodo ng'hatu cha lukuli, ila wanguweza kidayila mbuli ng'hulu ng'hatu. Mlole chiluli chido choweza kusoma chisosolo chikulu. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Nawo umyango ufanda kota chiluli. Umyango umema wihe wa chila mbuli. Umyango ndo honhu hado ha lukuli lwa hetwe, ila naugalaga wihe kuli lukuli lweng'ha. Umyango usomaga ukomu wa hetwe kulawa kuvumbuka mbaka kubagama, kwa vila nawo wangusomigwa na chiluli cha Jehanamu.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Munhu kanguweza kujifuga migongolo na chila nhanzi ya migongolo na videje na vilingutambala na vinhu viwele mbahali, vyangudimigwa navyo mina navifujigwa na wanhu. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Ila kuduhu munhu yawezile kudima umyango. Umyango ndo chinhu chihile, umema dunga ilingukopola wanhu, <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />kwa umyango twanguta malumbo Mkulu na Mhaza wa hetwe na kwa umyango wuwo, twanguwapanjila wanhu, wanhu wawele walumbigwe kwa kiwhana na Nguluwi. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mgati mwa mlomo umwe mwangulawa ulonzi wa kutogola na wa kupanjila. Wang'holozangu, mbuli azi hazilinguganigwa ziwe ahi. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ndaze, nzasa imwe yoweza kulavya mazi ganojile na mazi gawele na mwino? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Wang'holozangu, ndaze, ikuyu lyoweza kulela mafuza ga masada? Ama igodi lya ing'ongo lyoweza kulela mafuza ga mtini? Hiho du, nzasa ilingulavya mazi gawele na mwino haiweza kulavya mazi ganojile.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lulingulawa kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Whaani, yawele na luhala na nyhala hali hemwe? Lelo, yalajile mbuli yila kwa madito ga heye ganojile kuli majendo ga heye ganojile na kwa madito ga heye ga uliholile galingukoleka kuli uliholile na luhala. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ila wone nhumbula za hemwe zimema fihi na maya na kigana mwemwe baho, lelo, mleche kitogola na kulonga udesi hali kukomya. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Luhala kota alo halulingudulika kulawa kilanga, ila ndo lwa chiisi na lwa chiwunhu, kahi ndo lwa chimazoga. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Mina honhu hawele na fihi na kigana mwemwe baho, ndo hawele na nongwa na chila mbuli yihile. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ila luhala lulingulawa kuchanya kilanga, inoga na kahi yangugana kikala goya na yangugana uliholile na kuwahulichiza wanhu wanji na imema isungu na madito ganojile, yangulela mafuza ga madito ganojile na yahela ubagulo na wala walingidaya wanoga aku wawele wahadi. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Wanhu walingugana kikala goya, wonyala nyhadikwa zinojile na wobeta mbena za kumnojeza Nguluwi.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Minyenyeteze hali Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ngondo na kilewa hali hemwe vyangulawila kohi? Vyangulawa kuli maya ga hemwe gehile gawele ngilewa mgati mli hemwe. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mwangugana kuwa na vinhu ila kwa vila hampegwa hebu, mwangugana kukopola, mwangugana ng'hatu kupegwa vinhu, ila hampegwa hebu, ahyo mwangilewa na kitowa. Hamuweza kupegwa chila chinhu chomlingugana kwa vila hamlinguchilanda kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Nahomlanda hampegwa hebu kwa vila mwangulanda kwa chiwalo cha mbuli zihile, mwangumlanda Nguluwi leka mugutize maya ga hemwe. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Hemwe mwa wanhu wohambemkunde kota wang'hondwa. Ndaze, hamvizelele kuwa mganwa wa isi, kangidita mng'honyo wa Nguluwi? Lelo heye yogana mbuli za chiisi kangidita mng'honyo wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Mleche kijesa kota Maandiko Matakatifu, gangulonga ulonzi wa hihi hela, vyogalingulonga, “Muhe yawele Nguluwi kamuwika mgati mwa hetwe kana maya ng'hatu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ila kunoga kwa Nguluwi kotulingupegwa na heye, kuna ludali ng'hatu, kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko, “Nguluwi kangitwanzaga na walingidaya, ila kanguwapaga uganililo wa heye walingunyenyetela.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Lelo mumhulichize Nguluwi, mlileme Limazoga naye kowabilimani. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mhejeleleni Nguluwi, naye kowahejelela hemwe. Muhovuje moko ga hemwe mwihile na kuhovuga nhumbula za hemwe, hemwe muwele na majesa meli. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Misinze na kulila na kulombocheza. Kuseka kwa hemwe kugaluche kuwa chililo na kusangalala kwa hemwe kugaluche kuwa masinzo makulu. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Muwe liholile hali Mkulu naye kowakwiniza.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa chiwalo cha kuwatagusa wanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Wang'holozangu, chila yumwe yaleche kulonga gehile kwa chiwalo cha myage. Yula yalingumlonga vibi mng'holoze na kumtagusa, ayo kangugalonga vibi malajizo na kugatagusa malajizo. Wone utagusa malajizo, leka, hegwe hulinguhulichiza malajizo, ila kwanguitagusa. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Nguluwi yaliyeng'ha ndo yalinguwika malajizo na kutagusa. Ndo yuye yaliyeng'ha yalinguweza kulohola na kubagamiza. Lelo, hegwe ulingumtagusa muyago ndo kwa whaani?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kidayila kwa chiwalo cha mitondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Munyhulichize lelo, hemwe mlingulonga, “Lehano ama mitondo, toluta kuli muji wunji, tochikala kula kwa mhela umwe, toguza vinhu na kupegwa lufufu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Hemwe hamlinguvizela ukomu wa hemwe woneche vyouwa mitondo. Ukomu wa hemwe ndo choni? Kwa vila hemwe mwa kota ng'hungugu ilingoneka mhela udo hela, hamba yangwaga. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Hemwe namwahaganigwe kulonga, “Wone Mkulu yagane, tochikala na kudita hino ama liyage.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ila sambi mwangidaya na kitogola. Kidaya kwa hemwe kweng'ha ako hakunojile hebu. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Lelo, munhu yalinguvizela kudita ganojile, ila halingudita, munhu ayo kangudita gehile.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa wawele na lufufu wehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Lelo muhulichize, hemwe wanhu muwele na lufufu na mlingulongoza, mlile na kulombocheza kwa chiwalo cha nongwa zilinguwoyela hemwe. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Lufufu lwenu lola na nguwo za hemwe nazidakulwa na fukuzi <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Zahabu na sendi za hemwe zigwa lungwi na lungwi lwake lowa ulolezi hali hemwe, nalo lodakula ng'huli za hemwe kota chiluli. Hemwe mikungajizila lufufu mli mazuwa aga ga kuduma. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Hamuwapele sendi wanhu walimile mli migunda ja hemwe, mhulichize iyowe lya hewo! Chililo cha wakolamijito walingubeta migunda ja hemwe, Mkulu wa wamizi yawele na ludali nakahulika kulila kwa hewo. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mikala kuli isi kwa kisangalaza nhumbula. Mineneheza mwagoya zuwa lya kudumuligwa singo. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Muwatagusa kwa wihe na kuwakopola wanhu wawele hela nongwa, nawo hambe wetwanze na hemwe.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwimilila na kulanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Lelo, wang'holozangu, mwimilile mbaka Mkulu hoyokuya. Mlole mlimi vyoyalingubeteza kwa wimililo mizuchila ja heye jilavye mbena inojile. Heye kangubeteza kwa kwimilila kulawila nhonya ya ng'humbusa walimi na luhela mbaka hala hoyobeta. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Hemwe namwe mkangaze nhumbula za hemwe na kwimilila nzinzili, mina zuwa lya kuya kwa heye Mkulu lyahabehi. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Wang'holozangu, mleche king'ung'utila chila yumwe, leka Nguluwi yaleche kuwatagusa. Milolele, mtagusa kahabehi, kema hali lwizi.<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Wang'holozangu, muwakumbuche waloli wa Nguluwi, nawegale usenga woyalonjile kwa itagwa lya Mkulu, mlole navyowemilile magazo, namwe mfande kota hewo. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Twanguwachema wanhu awo wabweda kwa vila nawemilila. Namuhulika mbuli ya kwimilila kwa Ayubu na mvizela vila Mkulu navyoyamditile kuli kuduma. Kwa vila Mkulu ka liholile na kamema isungu. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Kwa konjezela wang'holozangu, lomuwele ngilaha, mleche kilaha kwa kilanga ama kuli isi ama kwa chinhu choneche. Mlonje, “Ena” wone mlingugana kulonga ena, namwe mlonje, “Hebu” wone mlingugana kulonga hebu, leka mleche kutaguswa na Nguluwi.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ndaze, hali hemwe hana munhu yafichilwe na nongwa? Yalande kwa Nguluwi. Ndaze, hana munhu yawele yasangalale? Kanguganigwa kwimba nzimbo za kutogola. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ndaze, kabaho mtamwa hali hemwe? Kanguganigwa kuwachema wasekulu wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, nawo womlandila kwa itagwa lya Mkulu na kumbakaliza mafuta. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ahyo, nawo howolanda kwa makundo, mtamwa kowa mkomu, naye Mkulu komwinula na gehile goyaditile gokusigwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Lelo, milonjele chila yumwe wihe wa hemwe na milandile leka musilwe matamwa. Kulanda kwa munhu yatanganiche kuna mong'ho wa kudita menji. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya nayali munhu kota hetwe. Heye nakalanda kwa kukangaza ng'hatu nhonya ileche kutowa, nhonya nahaitowile hali isi kwa myaka jidatu na myezi sita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Hamba nakalanda kahi, nako kilanga nakigala nhonya, na isi ilavya vilyo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Wang'holozangu, wone munhu yumwe yahadigwe na yajilile kutali na kukomya, naye kahiluswa na munhu yunji, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mvizele kota, yula yomhilusa yawele na gehile kulawa kuli nzila ya heye ya kwajilila, koilohola nhumbula ayo kuli kubagama na gehile menji gokusigwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>